        {
          "id": "hair-salon.length.p3",
          "role": "review",
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "長さは揃えるくらいでいいですか？",
          "voice": "Kore",
          "speed": "normal",
          "ambience": false,
          "screen": null,
          "audio": "hair-salon.length.p3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要剪掉多少長度",
            "zh-Hans": "要剪掉多少长度",
            "en": "How much length to cut"
          },
          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "瀏海要怎麼剪",
            "zh-Hans": "刘海要怎么剪",
            "en": "What to do with your fringe"
          },
          "correct": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": {
            "zh-Hant": "要不要打薄",
            "zh-Hans": "要不要打薄",
            "en": "Do you want it thinned"
          },
          "correct": false
        }
      ],
      "response": {
        "ja": "3センチくらいでお願いします",
        "audio": "hair-salon.length.response.mp3",
        "voice": "Orus"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "zh-Hant": "「長さ」是長度，「揃える」是只修齊、長度不太變。說「3センチくらいで」或「揃えるだけで」。剪錯不好救，最好配照片或用手比位置。",
        "zh-Hans": "「長さ」是长度，「揃える」是只修齐、长度不太变。说「3センチくらいで」或「揃えるだけで」。剪错不好补救，最好配照片或用手比位置。",
        "en": "長さ is length, and 揃える means just tidying the ends without losing much length. Say 3センチくらいで or 揃えるだけで. A wrong cut is hard to undo, so a photo or pointing helps."
      },
      "wordIds": [
        "haircut"
      ],
      "reviewNote": "Hair terms (揃える) and the cm phrasing should be checked by a hairdresser."
    },
